    end_of_turn random encounter, ~25% chance (rand_byte()<0x40): picks a random treasure-array slot (rand_byte()&0xF indexes player._ringOwned[]) and decrements it by 1 if owned -- an unprotected item-loss encounter, no resist mechanic like the paralysis/sleep traps above.

